**Explanation:**  
- The patch wraps the proj4 transform functions to swap coordinates if the axis orientation is not `'enu'` (the default `[x, y]` order).
- This ensures that OpenLayers always passes and receives coordinates in `[x, y]` order, regardless of the axis order expected by proj4js.

